Modifications

This repository does not change the copy in this directory. It modifies the
text through the edit files under prompts/ (h_adaptation.yaml, g_from_h.yaml
and h_noskip_from_h.yaml). src/hoh/prompts.py applies those edits and writes
the modified texts to build/prompts/. Each edit file lists every change made
to the original text and the reason for it.
